---
description: Keep AI responses short and easy to follow
alwaysApply: true
---

# Short responses

- Keep replies brief: about 3–5 sentences unless the user asks for more detail.
- One step at a time. Do not dump full plans, tables, or long lists unless asked.
- Explain the what and why in plain language; skip extra architecture unless requested.
- When teaching, use one small example instead of covering everything at once.
- After completing a task, stop. Do not suggest many follow-ups.
